{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c34c7dcd3802f37f939a7fb7f9cf3495e6740b6be14a462e46fa3c347692cec4", "ja": "（風花の新しい衣装のフィッティングが終わったと\n連絡があった。さて、様子を見に行ってみよう……）", "zh": "（收到了风花的新服装试穿已经结束的联系。那么，去看看她的情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f638bc72871c0cfd0612ddc1be23085c067b3d50faa1009c40696e01415d34ed", "ja": "風花、お疲れさ……。", "zh": "风花，辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eba44ebdede9f1908b3373c18dfe7db3d4489018292857708ed5bd3e6ce75054", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　素敵な衣装を……\n本当～にありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！这么棒的服装……\n真的～非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5a2ff83b69c5110fcdddb29bdec5771c33a4f76607e692f27fc7b4e0f9106848", "ja": "お、おお。どういたしまして……？", "zh": "哦、哦哦。不、不用客气……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a09603532dcccc2af64397134247b4a8c73bd7be08ed297370d238ce38ce2771", "ja": "あ……す、すみません。\n私ったら、つい浮かれちゃって……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起。\n我一不小心就得意忘形了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ace59c0894e939dbdc4bd0d15db0b475dbb212a3bf366d87986cdd69d6ab5d2e", "ja": "そうか。\nいや、風花が喜んでくれたみたいで嬉しいよ。", "zh": "这样啊。\n不，看到风花好像很开心，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8c34acae9b871ecf46b5b592ff86e3c301aa7a444bd5ee987776ce3197fcd83e", "ja": "ふふっ。えっと、それで……ですね。\n私……謝らないといけないことがあるんです。", "zh": "呵呵。那个，所以……呢。\n我……有件事必须向您道歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "afb77b2a9a12158e7a5d921adfe0f6003b0ed7546de0d6e24e6aa9af4a1d8eab", "ja": "謝る？", "zh": "要道歉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b118669084e3482c068c74f9bab9132f151a363700af78667a35ea5236953c77", "ja": "その……ごめんなさい！\n{$P$}さんのこと、誤解してました。", "zh": "那个……对不起！\n我误会{$P$}先生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2837541ca458e747f1ada094731f8dc5585cb16f0e031141dbe4358399f07b4e", "ja": "私、{$P$}さんは私に、\n大人っぽいセクシーなところを求めているから……", "zh": "我以为……{$P$}先生希望我展现出\n成熟性感的一面，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9cc2a8f97ff9fb0d975c1bc4aa396cfea8ac89e4e9573fb8e8cb3a0e46441cfa", "ja": "今回もきっと、そういう衣装が用意されるんだって、\n勝手に思ってたんです。本当にごめんなさい！", "zh": "我擅自以为这次肯定也会准备那种风格的服装。真的很对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73899d9be672a76a0f2ed0655a922448ccadca16a5119f93b8c959856422d81a", "ja": "でもこの衣装を用意してくれたんだから。正統派\nアイドルを目指してもいいってことかなって……。", "zh": "不过，既然你为我准备了这套服装，那是不是说明……我也可以以成为正统派偶像为目标呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2d8f0e38a779386071bc8a581af7195d06c506a61a9c2b4c721a99cacc6571c9", "ja": "もちろんだよ。仕事の話は耳が痛いけど……。\n風花の魅力は、セクシーだけじゃないからな。", "zh": "当然可以。虽然说到工作方面的话题有点刺耳……但风花的魅力可不只有性感啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3625f892e87cfbbd3b1589bfb851e179d293aaa863fc20f80c920793c7ddbce3", "ja": "この衣装は『癒やし』や『神秘性』をモチーフに、\n風花の雰囲気に合わせて作ってもらったんだ。", "zh": "这套服装是以“治愈”和“神秘感”为主题，配合风花的气质请人设计制作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c077581218b8dd4b9f6f91c9c2d0e64c40d3b322c277884dd5c4a43cf18d5669", "ja": "そうだったんですね……。癒やしとか神秘性は、\nちょっとくすぐったい感じがしますけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……“治愈”和“神秘感”，总觉得让人有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d8c5e1bcac959b8cf418bb5635ecc2c5ddbfce85b1ef79f6481ee6e5e5e879b9", "ja": "私が、ファンの人たちを癒せるなら……。\n私のステージで、たくさんの人を笑顔にできるなら。", "zh": "如果我能治愈粉丝们……。\n如果我的舞台能让很多人露出笑容的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b89ba40560bbed5c83561084010cb1509f51348a5a015bbfde1884b390ae4a2a", "ja": "それは、とっても素敵なことですよね？", "zh": "那真的是一件非常美好的事，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2e893168770a4d297e4ea40b544d712a7dbe16a48eeed67536ae46eb7d7fca38", "ja": "ああ。風花ならできる……というか、\n風花にしかできないことだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。要是风花的话一定能做到……应该说，\n我觉得这是只有风花才能做到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c21acb0bcd1b4cda98106ecdcef1782ae7fa7c4a803d1799d314e6d49db0b613", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n{$P$}さんのお墨付きなら安心です。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n既然有{$P$}先生的保证，那我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d2de4ee0d7bb50ae4ea493d60831e6a741a185d90d04cabd51f8a580580a3751", "ja": "私、この素敵な衣装の力を借りて、\nたくさんの癒やしを届けようと思います。", "zh": "我想借助这套美丽服装的力量，\n为大家送去满满的治愈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "78f306c5a34019813580c40cb3daaedb4ba375b02d974ee915304b57aeac9f27", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}さんも……\nって、あれ？　あの、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "当然，还要为{$P$}先生……\n咦，奇怪？那个，能耽误您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1022_p", "source_sha256": "51166b2b6d3a0e733766d51a9d2a15a751b72a8a0f2c1574da3563c8b3860c61", "ja": "え？　ちょ……風花？", "zh": "诶？等、等一下……风花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "37fb49e44ab36740f7934c4c77d8a02571b36161c0eedb768a3bf7401b67c7b6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ちゃんと寝てますか？\n昨夜、寝たのは何時ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你有好好睡觉吗？\n昨晚是几点睡的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fd648ebee1c46d1a00f2e9efce92daf5863316fb2e704dc8ef9d13f0a41206b5", "ja": "あーその……寝たのは2……3時だったかな……？", "zh": "啊——那个……大概是2……3点睡的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0374_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e2cb2f7522fd5ea8329c1358c6f5c2e9bbba76bdeda686293794cf4d1cca20de", "ja": "もう！　もっと自分の健康も気にしてください！\nそうでなくちゃ、癒せるものも癒せませんからね？", "zh": "真是的！请再多注意一下自己的身体健康！\n不然的话，就算想治愈您也治愈不了了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
